subheading("C", "Dataset Composition")
para(
    "Table V lists the exact per-class composition of every split. Training and validation images are a "
    "uniform random subset (seed 42) of the 54,000 non-Sandal images in the Fashion-MNIST training partition, "
    "so class frequencies vary slightly around the 1,111-image mean, as shown. The test set uses the official "
    "Fashion-MNIST test partition: 9,000 normal images (exactly 1,000 per remaining class) plus 1,000 "
    "held-out Sandals. No Sandal image appears in training or validation under any circumstance."
)
add_table(
